### ==============================================================================
### NexusFlow Enterprise Multi-Agent Architecture - Complete API Testing Suite
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Health Diagnostics & System Readiness
# Verifies system health, DB connection to MS SQL Server, and configured AI models
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 2. Standalone Code Execution Sandbox - Python
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflow/validate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "def fibonacci(n):\n    if n <= 1:\n        return n\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n    return b\n\nassert fibonacci(10) == 55\nprint('Fibonacci calculation successful: fib(10) =', fibonacci(10))",
  "language": "python"
}

###

### 3. Standalone Code Execution Sandbox - Node.js / JavaScript
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflow/validate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "const sum = [10, 20, 30, 40].reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\nconsole.log('Node.js array reduction:', sum);",
  "language": "javascript"
}

###

### 4. Automated Static Security & Vulnerability Scan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflow/security-scan
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "import os\nuser_input = 'admin'\n# Insecure dynamic evaluation and shell execution\neval('1 + 1')\nos.system('echo ' + user_input)\n"
}

