### 5. Execution History Retrieval (MS SQL Server)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workflow/history?limit=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 6. Platform Performance Analytics (MS SQL Server)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workflow/analytics
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 7. Synchronous Multi-Agent Workflow Execution
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflow/execute
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "prompt": "Create a high-performance Python LRU Cache class with get, put, capacity limit, and unit tests using unittest.",
  "session_id": "test-session-lru-cache-001",
  "max_iterations": 3,
  "language": "python"
}

###

### 8. Asynchronous Real-Time Server-Sent Events (SSE) Streaming
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflow/stream
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "prompt": "Build an algorithmic binary search tree in Python with insert, search, in-order traversal, and unit tests.",
  "session_id": "test-session-bst-stream-002",
  "max_iterations": 3,
  "language": "python"
}

